#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ripeto.php
msgid "Plogins Reorder - One-Click Reorder for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: ripeto.php
msgid "https://plogins.com/plogins-reorder/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: ripeto.php
msgid ""
"Add a one-click reorder button to past orders so customers can re-add every "
"still-purchasable item to the cart and buy again fast."
msgstr ""
"Añade un botón para reordenar con un solo clic a pedidos anteriores para que "
"los clientes puedan volver a añadir al carrito todos los artículos que aún "
"se pueden comprar y volver a comprar rápidamente."

#. Author of the plugin
#: ripeto.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: ripeto.php
msgid "https://wppoland.com"
msgstr "https://wppoland.com"

#. translators: 1: Required PHP version, 2: Current PHP version
#: ripeto.php:55
#, php-format
msgid "Reorder requires PHP %1$s or higher. You are running PHP %2$s."
msgstr "Reordenar requiere PHP %1$s o superior. Estás ejecutando PHP %2$s."

#: ripeto.php:74
msgid "Reorder requires WooCommerce to be installed and activated."
msgstr "Reordenar requiere que WooCommerce esté instalado y activado."

#. translators: 1: Required WC version, 2: Current WC version
#: ripeto.php:86
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Reorder requires WooCommerce %1$s or higher. You are running WooCommerce "
"%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Reordenar requiere WooCommerce %1$s o superior. Estás ejecutando WooCommerce "
"%2$s."

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:78
msgid "Wkrótce"
msgstr "Próximamente"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:78
msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Próximamente"

#. translators: 1: currency symbol, 2: yearly price
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:84
#, php-format
msgid "from %1$s%2$d/yr"
msgstr "desde %1$s%2$d/año"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:93
msgid "Upgrade to PRO"
msgstr "Mejora a PRO"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:94
msgid "Powiadom mnie"
msgstr "Avísame"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:94
msgid "Get notified"
msgstr "Avísame"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:124
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "Permiso denegado."

#. translators: %s: PRO edition name
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:154
#, php-format
msgid "Do more with %s"
msgstr "Haz más con %s"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:161
msgid "Dismiss this notice"
msgstr "Descartar este aviso"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:178
msgid "Unlock every PRO feature"
msgstr "Desbloquea todas las funciones PRO"

#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:191
msgid "one licence, every PRO feature"
msgstr "una licencia, todas las funciones PRO"

#. translators: %s: PRO edition name
#: src/Admin/ProUpsell.php:210
#, php-format
msgid "What %s adds"
msgstr "Lo que añade %s"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:50
msgid "Reorder Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes de Reorder"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:51
msgid "Reorder"
msgstr "Reordenar"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:71
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:93
msgid "The button"
msgstr "el botón"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:95
msgid ""
"Set what the reorder button says and where it takes the customer. The "
"preview shows exactly what they will see in My Account."
msgstr ""
"Establece lo que dice el botón de reordenar y adónde lleva al cliente. La "
"vista previa muestra exactamente lo que verán en Mi cuenta."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:102
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Texto del botón"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:109 src/Admin/Settings.php:284
#: src/Settings/SettingsRepository.php:58
msgid "Order again"
msgstr "Ordena de nuevo"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:110
msgid ""
"Label shown on the reorder button in My Account. An action phrase such as "
"\"Order again\" or \"Buy these again\" works well. Leave blank to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Etiqueta que se muestra en el botón de reordenar en Mi cuenta. Una frase de "
"acción como \"Ordena de nuevo\" o \"Cómpralos de nuevo\" funciona bien. "
"Déjalo en blanco para usar el valor predeterminado."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:116
msgid "After reordering"
msgstr "Después de reordenar"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:122
msgid ""
"Where to send the customer once their items are back in the cart. Send "
"straight to checkout for the fastest repeat purchase, or to the cart so they "
"can review and adjust first."
msgstr ""
"Dónde enviar al cliente una vez que sus artículos estén nuevamente en el "
"carrito. Envíalo directamente a la caja para repetir la compra más "
"rápidamente, o al carrito para que puedan revisarlo y ajustarlo primero."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:128
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Avance"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:138
msgid "Where it appears"
msgstr "donde aparece"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:140
msgid "Choose which past orders show a reorder button."
msgstr "Elige qué pedidos anteriores muestran un botón para reordenar."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:147
msgid "Order statuses"
msgstr "Estados de pedido"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:153
msgid ""
"The button only appears on orders with one of the ticked statuses. "
"\"Completed\" is the usual choice; add \"Processing\" if you want customers "
"to reorder before fulfilment."
msgstr ""
"El botón sólo aparece en pedidos con uno de los estados marcados. "
"\"Completado\" es la opción habitual; añade \"Procesamiento\" si quieres que "
"los clientes vuelvan a realizar pedidos antes del cumplimiento."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:170
msgid ""
"Add a one-click reorder button to past orders so customers can buy the same "
"items again in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Añade un botón para reordenar con un solo clic a pedidos anteriores para que "
"los clientes puedan volver a comprar los mismos artículos en segundos."

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:226
msgid "Go to the cart"
msgstr "ir al carrito"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:227
msgid "Go straight to checkout"
msgstr "Ir directamente a la caja"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:278
msgid "the cart"
msgstr "el carro"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:279
msgid "checkout"
msgstr "pagar"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:291
msgid "In My Account > Orders"
msgstr "En Mi Cuenta > Pedidos"

#. translators: %s: the cart or checkout destination, e.g. "the cart".
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:301
#, php-format
msgid "After clicking, the order is re-added and the customer is taken to %s."
msgstr ""
"Después de hacer clic, el pedido se vuelve a añadir y el cliente es llevado "
"a %s."

#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:84
msgid "That reorder link has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "Ese enlace de reorden ha caducado. Por favor inténtalo de nuevo."

#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:99
msgid "We could not find that order."
msgstr "No pudimos encontrar ese pedido."

#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:115
msgid "The cart is not available right now. Please try again."
msgstr ""
"El carrito no está disponible en este momento. Por favor inténtalo de nuevo."

#. translators: %d: number of items added back to the cart.
#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:190
#, php-format
msgid "%d item from your order was added back to the cart."
msgid_plural "%d items from your order were added back to the cart."
msgstr[0] "%d artículo de tu pedido se volvió a añadir al carrito."
msgstr[1] "%d artículos de tu pedido se agregaron nuevamente al carrito."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of product names that could not be re-added.
#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "These items are no longer available and were skipped: %s"
msgstr "Estos elementos ya no están disponibles y se omitieron: %s"

#: src/Service/ReorderService.php:209
msgid "There was nothing from that order to add to the cart."
msgstr "No había nada de ese pedido para añadir al carrito."

